# Product: Escrowd

Escrow for illustration commissions (Cursor x Paymob Cairo Buildathon). Canonical spec: `docs/plan.md`.

One mechanism: **deposit starts work, balance unlocks the file.** One table. Arabic-first RTL. Reuse `src/lib/paymob.ts` — do not rewrite HMAC.

## Build today

- Public brief with live price, order at `/o/[token]`, Nour dashboard
- Two real Paymob Unified Checkout payments (deposit then balance)
- HMAC-verified webhook as the only paid signal

## Do not build today

AI pricing, Scope Guard, lead score, change orders, chat, client accounts, fake/simulated card UI, ParkIt-style payment screens, subscriptions.

If a prompt asks for those, refuse and point at `docs/plan.md`. Roadmap one-liner for judges: paid change orders later.

Always update `docs/plan.md`, `docs/Architecture.md`, `docs/changelog.md`, `README.md`, and all agent files (`AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, `cursor.md`, `grok.md`) in the same turn as a contract change. See `docs-sync.mdc`.

## Non-negotiable

- Never fake Paymob checkout. Redirect to hosted Unified Checkout only.
- Never mark paid from the browser redirect or a dashboard PATCH.
- Clients have no login. Nour does.
- Event challenge may differ: keep two-payment + webhook + secret status page; swap the form, not the payment model.
